{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000008", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000010"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Price growth turned negative for the first time in this cycle back in Q4 2025. And then it was unexpected because of supply. 24,800 units completed in the first half of this year alone, up 37.6% compared to the first six months of 2025.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000010"}], "text": "Price growth turned negative in Q4 2025 due to unexpected supply, with 24,800 units completed in the first half of the year, up 37.6% compared to the first six months of 2025."}, "title": "Dubai Real Estate Cycle", "topic": "Dubai real estate market"}, "content_hash": "008346bbddb770d77dd5d40c0f919d5bfacb9e82da560937ba1e3c8fa5f96fa6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:knowledge:cc9bbfcebb718768", "metadata_hash": "d19427ca739dfaa20805ee3039e466031d14d51175d46b6a0a224577647995c1", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "70b33662fa14bb477ac0c99e9fc18d5533e4e9b16775e8238d19246e3a905a6a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3kBUFkV0O9k", "title": "Dubai Real Estate Cycle", "topic": "Dubai real estate market", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate-market"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [{"citations": [{"quote": "twenty percent is calculated on the full value of the unit, but you only ever put in half of it. So, twenty percent tries becomes roughly a fifty percent return on the money you actually deposit.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000012"}], "text": "The return is approximately fifty percent on the money actually deposited."}], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000011", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000012", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000013"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "It was the exit, the ability to get out of the profit in twenty twenty four and twenty twenty five.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000011"}], "text": "To get out with a profit in Dubai real estate."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "You buy offline on a payment plan.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000011"}], "text": "Buy off-plan on a payment plan."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "Over the construction period, you pay roughly fifty percent of the price.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000012"}], "text": "Over the construction period, pay roughly 50% of the price."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "before that final payment ever comes due, you sell the unit onto somebody else.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000012"}], "text": "Sell the unit before the final payment is due, benefiting from the price increase."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Over the construction period, you pay roughly fifty percent of the price. And before handover, before that final payment ever comes due, you sell the unit onto somebody else.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000012"}], "text": "An exit strategy involved buying off-plan, paying 50% during construction, and selling before the final payment, benefiting from a price increase which translated to a 50% return on the money deposited."}, "title": "Exit Strategy in Dubai Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai real estate investment"}, "content_hash": "008346bbddb770d77dd5d40c0f919d5bfacb9e82da560937ba1e3c8fa5f96fa6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:knowledge:d8bbd545080368b4", "metadata_hash": "d19427ca739dfaa20805ee3039e466031d14d51175d46b6a0a224577647995c1", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "70b33662fa14bb477ac0c99e9fc18d5533e4e9b16775e8238d19246e3a905a6a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3kBUFkV0O9k", "title": "Exit Strategy in Dubai Real Estate", "topic": "Dubai real estate investment", "topic_slug": "dubai-real-estate-investment"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000023", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000024", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000025", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000026"], "exceptions": [{"citations": [{"quote": "if the agent says there is no cons, everything is great, leave. There is no such a thing.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000026"}], "text": "If an agent claims there are no cons, they may not know the product well or chose not to disclose information."}], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "knowing how to qualify the agent in ten minutes.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000022"}], "text": "To assess whether a real estate agent is knowledgeable and trustworthy."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Show me the last three months of transactions in this building. And if it's offline in comparable building around the area.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000024"}], "text": "Ask the agent to show the last three months of transactions in the building or comparable buildings around the area."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "what else completes around me in the same year? Because if three other towers handed over the same year, the same month, your tenant has options and your buyer has options.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000025"}], "text": "Ask about other buildings completing in the same year to assess tenant and buyer options."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "what are the service charges here and what are the incomparable buildings in the same area?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000025"}], "text": "Inquire about service charges and compare them to buildings in the same area."}, {"citations": [{"quote": "What are the cons of the building? What can go wrong with the developer or with the area?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000026"}], "text": "Ask about the cons of the building and potential issues with the developer or area."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Four questions. Ask them and if the agent hesitates, you already have your answer about whether you should work with this person or no.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000023"}], "text": "A method to qualify real estate agents involves asking specific questions about recent transactions, upcoming completions, service charges, and potential cons of the property."}, "title": "Identifying Trustworthy Real Estate Agents", "topic": "Real estate agent qualification"}, "content_hash": "008346bbddb770d77dd5d40c0f919d5bfacb9e82da560937ba1e3c8fa5f96fa6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:knowledge:4f24e7a547fa8c8f", "metadata_hash": "d19427ca739dfaa20805ee3039e466031d14d51175d46b6a0a224577647995c1", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-25", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "70b33662fa14bb477ac0c99e9fc18d5533e4e9b16775e8238d19246e3a905a6a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3kBUFkV0O9k", "title": "Identifying Trustworthy Real Estate Agents", "topic": "Real estate agent qualification", "topic_slug": "real-estate-agent-qualification"}
{"author": "olgasi", "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000018", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000020"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "he's sitting on the quote of the million late payment fees, unable to rent it out and access the unit to start covering it from his rent.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000018"}], "text": "The investor could not rent out the property and faced late payment fees."}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": {"citations": [{"quote": "There was not much I could do for him. He he came to me too late.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000020"}], "text": "The session with the advisor could not offer a solution as it was too late."}, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "He didn't have the cash to reach that point, and he could have sold last year. There was a window, and he let it close, waiting for a better price whilst the unit completed.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000019"}], "text": "The investor could have sold the property last year but waited for a better price."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "good location, bought from Shoba Oplan several years ago. And it's completed, keys are ready.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:u000018"}], "text": "An investor miscalculated the exit strategy for a purchased property."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Miscalculation in Real Estate Exit", "topic": "Real estate investment"}, "content_hash": "008346bbddb770d77dd5d40c0f919d5bfacb9e82da560937ba1e3c8fa5f96fa6", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2:cases:317227d5f0a4ad89", "metadata_hash": "d19427ca739dfaa20805ee3039e466031d14d51175d46b6a0a224577647995c1", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-09-25", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "70b33662fa14bb477ac0c99e9fc18d5533e4e9b16775e8238d19246e3a905a6a", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-09-25-what-changed-in-dubai-real-estate-in-2026-falling-resales-ha-f4d1591cf2", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3kBUFkV0O9k", "title": "Miscalculation in Real Estate Exit", "topic": "Real estate investment", "topic_slug": "real-estate-investment"}
